H* INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
H* Demonstrates RPG II features: file I/O, calculations, arrays, strings
H*
FINVENTORYIP  F  80  80            DISK
FREPORT   O   F 132 132            PRINTER
F*
I* Input file: INVENTORY (Product inventory records)
IINVENTORY NS  01
I                                        1   5 PCODE
I                                        6  35 PDESC
I                                       36  43 2PRICE
I                                       44  49 0QTY
I                                       50  57 2COST
I*
C* Data structures for calculations
C           PCODE     CAT   PDESC     PNAME    35
C           PRICE     MULT  QTY       EXTPRC   92
C           EXTPRC    SUB   COST      PROFIT   92
C*
C* Array for top 5 products
C           TOPQTY    SORTA                    5
C           TOPQTY    XFOOT           TOTQTY   50
C*
C* String operations
C           PDESC     SCAN  'WIDGET'  POS      20
C           PDESC     SUBST 1    10   SHORT    10
C           SHORT     TRIM            TRIMMED  10
C*
C* Math operations
C           PRICE     SQRT            SQRTP    82
C           QTY       DIV   3         THIRD    20
C           QTY       MVR   3         REMAIN   20
C*
C* Half-adjust example
C           PRICE     ADD   0.005     ROUNDP  82H
C*
C* Indicators and comparisons
C           QTY       COMP  100              5152
C  51                 SETON                       53
C  52                 SETOF                       53
C*
C* Output to report
O*
OREPORT    H    1P
O                                       30 'INVENTORY REPORT'
O          H    1P
O                                       10 'CODE'
O                                       40 'DESCRIPTION'
O                                       55 'PRICE'
O                                       70 'QTY'
O                                       85 'VALUE'
O          H    1P
O                                       85 '----------'
O*
OREPORT    D    01
O                    PCODE              10
O                    PDESC              40
O                    PRICE         1    55
O                    QTY                70
O                    EXTPRC        1    85
O*
OREPORT    T    LR
O                                       40 'TOTAL QUANTITY:'
O                    TOTQTY             70